msgid "I/O observations, capacity and retained recovery"
msgstr "I/O observations, capacity and retained recovery"

msgid ""
"本轮 IO07、IO09、IO10 使用显式、调用方持有的诊断对象。默认 request、stream、slot 和 owner "
"的字段不变，平台不建立全局采样器、隐藏线程或自动恢复设备的策略。诊断 观察实际状态；deadline、错误或诊断对象的 detach "
"都不撤销已经接受的借用。"
msgstr ""
"IO07, IO09 and IO10 use explicit caller-owned diagnostic objects. Default "
"request, stream, slot and owner fields remain unchanged; the platform "
"creates no global sampler, hidden thread or automatic device-recovery "
"policy. Diagnostics observe actual state; deadlines, errors and diagnostic "
"detach never revoke accepted borrows."

msgid "Request 的稳定身份观察"
msgstr "Observing a request through stable identity"

msgid ""
"Core 的 `request_observer.h` 仅依赖 Core。调用方将一个清零的 `nx_request_observer_t` 绑定到稳定"
" slot 和非零 epoch。sample 先核对仍然存在的 同一 incarnation，再访问 request；不会缓存 request "
"指针。slot 被释放或复用后， 旧 observer 返回 STATE。epoch 不循环复用，达到上限后由既有 slot 合同拒绝继续接入。"
msgstr ""
"Core's `request_observer.h` depends only on Core. The caller binds a zeroed "
"`nx_request_observer_t` to a stable slot and nonzero epoch. Sample first "
"verifies the same live incarnation before accessing the request; it caches "
"no request pointer. After slot release or reuse, the old observer returns "
"STATE. Epochs never wrap for reuse; the existing slot contract rejects "
"further admission at the limit."

msgid ""
"调用方排除 sample 与 slot bind/release、request prepare/reuse 以及 observer 本身 "
"的并发修改，并保证绑定存储始终有效。Core 不替调用方增加 IRQ mask、OS 锁或多核 同步。普通设备的执行者仍可推进 request；只有 "
"acquire 观察到 SETTLED 后才读取最终 result/count。借用期间输出 "
"result=BUSY、count=0，避免把尚未发布的结果当成有效值。"
msgstr ""
"The caller excludes concurrent sample versus slot bind/release, request "
"prepare/reuse and observer mutation, and ensures bound storage remains "
"valid. Core adds no IRQ mask, OS lock or multicore synchronization on the "
"caller's behalf. Normal device executors may still advance requests; final "
"result/count is read only after acquire-observed SETTLED. While borrowed, "
"outputs are result=BUSY and count=0, preventing unpublished results from "
"appearing valid."

msgid ""
"时间戳与 request deadline 处于同一单调时钟域。逆跳返回 IO、保留输出与最后有效时间， 诊断计数饱和。max_gap 和 "
"transitions 只描述两次采样之间的观察差异，不是硬件完成 时间、所有内部状态转换或 WCET。detach 只解除观察绑定，允许在 "
"QUARANTINED 时执行， 但随后仍必须排空实际设备借用。"
msgstr ""
"Timestamps share the request deadline's monotonic clock domain. Backward "
"time returns IO, preserving outputs and the last valid time; diagnostic "
"counters saturate. max_gap and transitions describe differences between "
"samples, not hardware completion time, all internal transitions or WCET. "
"Detach removes only observation binding and is permitted during QUARANTINED,"
" but actual device borrows must still be drained afterward."

msgid ""
"输出必须与完整 descriptor、payload 和控制存储分离。公共 Core 仅知道 request 基类 大小，不能验证派生 "
"descriptor 的全部区域，也不能探测已经释放的 C 指针。拥有者通常 会在 outer SETTLED 前释放自己的控制 slot；此后观察该 "
"slot 得到 STATE。若需要在 最终结果发布后继续采样，调用方应持有自己的独立稳定 slot，并在自身读者退出后释放。"
msgstr ""
"Outputs must be separate from the complete descriptor, payload and control "
"storage. Public Core knows only the request base size and cannot validate "
"the full derived-descriptor range or detect freed C pointers. Owners usually"
" release their control slot before outer SETTLED; observing that slot then "
"returns STATE. To continue sampling after final-result publication, the "
"caller should retain its own independent stable slot and release it after "
"its readers exit."

msgid "Owner 的显式进度诊断"
msgstr "Explicit owner progress diagnostics"

msgid ""
"可选 `Nexus::OwnerObserver` 由唯一 owner 执行者调用。每次调用恰好执行一次真实 "
"`nx_bus_owner_service`，原样返回服务结果。BUSY 单独计数，其他错误另计；观察时钟 逆跳写入 "
"diagnostic_result，不覆盖 service_result，也不阻止继续 drain。"
msgstr ""
"Optional `Nexus::OwnerObserver` is called by the sole owner executor. Each "
"call executes exactly one real `nx_bus_owner_service` and returns its result"
" unchanged. BUSY is counted separately from other errors. Backward "
"observation time sets diagnostic_result without overwriting service_result "
"or preventing continued drain."

msgid ""
"随后在已有短 metadata guard 内复制 active ticket、request state 和 idle；不调用 "
"硬件、不遍历槽数组。复制结果不保留 request/payload 引用。quarantines 是观察次数， 不是失败操作数量。服务 SUCCESS "
"也不等于当前 operation 最终 SUCCESS；最终结果仍通过 acquire-observed request result 获取。它不会从 "
"void device service 推测不存在的错误。"
msgstr ""
"It then copies active ticket, request state and idle under the existing "
"short metadata guard, without hardware calls or slot-array scans. Copies "
"retain no request/payload references. quarantines counts observations, not "
"failed operations. Service SUCCESS does not mean the current operation "
"finally succeeded; final results still come through acquire-observed request"
" results. It does not infer nonexistent errors from void device service."

msgid ""
"observer、owner、slots 和 guard/executor/clock 必须保持同一绑定及生命周期。生产者 继续使用原 owner "
"guard；执行者不会因接入诊断增加一层设备热路径 vtable。detach 后 owner 继续拥有所有未排空工作。诊断输出也不得覆盖已接受的 "
"operation 或 payload。"
msgstr ""
"Observer, owner, slots and guard/executor/clock must retain the same binding"
" and lifecycle. Producers keep the original owner guard; diagnostics add no "
"device hot-path vtable layer. After detach, the owner still owns all "
"undrained work. Diagnostic outputs must not overwrite accepted operations or"
" payloads."

msgid "Stream 快照与容量预算"
msgstr "Stream snapshots and capacity budgets"

msgid ""
"`nx_stream_observe` 在一次短 IRQ guard 中复制 maintained aggregates，工作量与 block "
"数量无关，不扫描 slot 或读取 payload。free_blocks 表示总空闲数；next_free 表示普通 stream producer "
"cursor 对应槽是否可用。乱序 release 可能使总空闲不为零而当前 cursor 仍被占用。preposted producer 有独立 "
"cursor，其下一目标必须用对应 reservation API 判断，不能把 next_free 当成连续 DMA 的下一目标许可。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_stream_observe` copies maintained aggregates under one short IRQ guard, "
"with work independent of block count and no slot scans or payload reads. "
"free_blocks is the total free count; next_free says whether the normal "
"stream producer cursor's slot is available. Out-of-order release can leave "
"free blocks while that cursor remains occupied. A preposted producer has its"
" own cursor and must determine its next target through the corresponding "
"reservation API; next_free is not permission for the next continuous-DMA "
"target."

msgid ""
"`nx_stream_budget_calculate` 是冷路径的纯检查，调用方声明 rate、block units、每 unit 字节、最长 "
"FIFO frontier release delay、硬件目标和 spare 数量。其计算为："
msgstr ""
"`nx_stream_budget_calculate` is a pure cold-path check. The caller declares "
"rate, block units, bytes per unit, maximum FIFO-frontier release delay, "
"hardware-target count and spare count. Its calculation is:"

msgid ""
"rate 和 block 使用相同单位。例如多通道 ADC 可使用完整 scan 作为单位，unit_bytes 显式包含每 scan 的全部通道。两次"
" uint64 乘法以及 size_t 加法/乘法均检查溢出；非法 输入或溢出保留旧输出并返回 "
"INVALID/EXHAUSTED，绝不饱和为一份貌似通过的预算。 configured_blocks >= required_blocks "
"才满足声明容量；目标换址 latency 必须严格小于 向下取整的 fill 时间。该结果不自动创建 backpressure，也不消除 FIFO "
"堵塞、CT ABA 或 实际时钟/IRQ 延迟。最终物理资格仍要求对应板卡的实测速率和最坏服务间隔。"
msgstr ""
"Rate and block use the same units. For example, multichannel ADC may use "
"complete scans, with unit_bytes explicitly covering every channel per scan. "
"Both uint64 multiplications and size_t addition/multiplication are overflow-"
"checked. Invalid input or overflow preserves old output and returns "
"INVALID/EXHAUSTED; it never saturates into an apparently valid budget. "
"configured_blocks >= required_blocks meets declared capacity; target-"
"replacement latency must be strictly below the rounded-down fill time. This "
"does not create backpressure or remove FIFO blocking, CT ABA or real "
"clock/IRQ latency. Physical qualification still needs measured rates and "
"worst-case service gaps for the board."

msgid "外部应用的隔离恢复策略"
msgstr "External application quarantine recovery policy"

msgid ""
"`nexus-examples/apps/uart_owner_runtime/quarantine_policy.c` 保留旧 SDK "
"pin，直接组合 已有 BusOwner API。真实 main 的 owner progress 位点均接入该策略，故服务错误会进入 "
"可观察的故障阶段，而非被 `(void)` 静默丢弃。BUSY 作为正常等待处理。"
msgstr ""
"`nexus-examples/apps/uart_owner_runtime/quarantine_policy.c` retains its old"
" SDK pin and directly composes existing BusOwner APIs. Actual main owner-"
"progress sites use this policy so service errors enter observable fault "
"stages instead of being silently discarded with `(void)`. BUSY is normal "
"waiting."

msgid ""
"实际错误关闭 admission，发布 FAULT_OBSERVED，并建立明确的有限清理时间/步数预算。 时钟逆跳、deadline "
"加法溢出或预算耗尽发布 ESCALATED_RETAINED。后续调用仍然执行真实 service；没有 kill "
"worker、reset、自动重放或归还未排空 buffer。实际 idle 最终发布 LOAN_DRAINED，但只证明 owner "
"借用已退出；producer join、IRQ detach、硬件 stop、 observer join 和通知销毁仍须按原生命周期次序完成。"
msgstr ""
"Real errors close admission, publish FAULT_OBSERVED and establish explicit "
"finite cleanup-time/step budgets. Backward time, deadline-add overflow or "
"budget exhaustion publishes ESCALATED_RETAINED. Later calls still perform "
"actual service; there is no worker kill, reset, automatic replay or "
"undrained-buffer return. Actual idle eventually publishes LOAN_DRAINED, "
"proving only owner loans ended. Producer join, IRQ detach, hardware stop, "
"observer join and notification destruction still follow original lifecycle "
"order."

msgid ""
"故障 sink 在 guard 外执行，必须有界且不重入。应用保存阶段和故障状态并唤醒协调者； "
"产品的安全输出、设备复位和现场处置仍归外部产品工程。这份示例策略不建立安全等级。"
msgstr ""
"The fault sink runs outside the guard and must be bounded and non-reentrant."
" Applications retain stages and fault state and wake the coordinator; "
"product safe outputs, device reset and field handling remain external "
"product-project responsibilities. This example establishes no safety level."

msgid "存储与验证边界"
msgstr "Storage and verification boundaries"

msgid ""
"以下是实际 Cortex-M4F GNU Arm 14.3、`-fshort-enums` ABI 的 sizeof fixture，数组符号 由实际 "
"ARM 编译并用 nm 读取。它只量显式对象布局，不冒充整镜像代码大小或物理周期。"
msgstr ""
"The following sizeof fixture uses the actual Cortex-M4F GNU Arm 14.3 "
"`-fshort-enums` ABI; array symbols are ARM-compiled and read with nm. It "
"measures explicit object layout only, not whole-image code size or physical "
"cycles."

