msgid ""
"测得默认 request 24、request slot 16、stream 40、stream slot 40、BusOwner 84、owner "
"slot 48 字节。默认结构没有新增字段；未选择 observer 时不创建上述 sidecar。其他 编译器、enum ABI 和 pointer "
"width 必须重新测量，不能直接套用这些数值。"
msgstr ""
"Measured default sizes are request 24, request slot 16, stream 40, stream "
"slot 40, BusOwner 84 and owner slot 48 bytes. Default structures gain no "
"fields; no sidecar is created when observers are unselected. Other "
"compilers, enum ABIs and pointer widths require fresh measurement rather "
"than reuse of these values."

msgid ""
"新增 Google suite 为 15 项 observer/budget 与 7 项 descriptor/provider state-"
"machine。 其中 Native UART 执行 32 条序列、SPI 16 条序列、ADC 4 条消费/停止序列；这些循环不是 额外 Google"
" case 数。I2C 的公共 dispatch 序列 mock 外部异步 provider 依赖，证明公共 借用/重试合同，不宣称 Native "
"I2C 异步硬件实现。外部示例 28 项实际 owner/lifecycle Google case 中新增 6 项 quarantine "
"policy。首次真实 stub RED 和最终 GREEN 原始日志、 fresh XML、命令与退出码保存于 "
"`tools/testing/evidence/io-observer-iteration/`。ARM32 容量检查曾触发 type-limits 严格"
" 编译错误；同一实际生产 ABI 的 RED/GREEN 与极端容量边界回归一起保留。"
msgstr ""
"New Google suites contain 15 observer/budget and 7 descriptor/provider "
"state-machine cases. Native UART executes 32 sequences, SPI 16 sequences, "
"and ADC 4 consume/stop sequences; these loops are not additional Google "
"cases. I2C public-dispatch sequences mock external asynchronous-provider "
"dependencies to prove public borrow/retry contracts, without claiming Native"
" I2C asynchronous hardware. Six quarantine-policy cases were added within "
"the external example's 28 actual owner/lifecycle Google cases. First real "
"stub RED and final GREEN logs, fresh XML, commands and return codes are "
"retained in `tools/testing/evidence/io-observer-iteration/`. ARM32 capacity "
"checks exposed a strict type-limits compilation error; RED/GREEN for the "
"same production ABI and extreme-capacity regressions are retained together."

msgid ""
"这些是开发软件证据。clean source SDK、外部消费者、完整候选矩阵由统一发布流程再次 绑定最终源码。实板未连接，物理 DMA "
"换址、错误注入、串口时序和安全输出均未执行。"
msgstr ""
"These are development software evidence. Clean-source SDK, external "
"consumers and the complete candidate matrix bind final sources again through"
" the unified release process. Boards are not connected; physical DMA target "
"switching, error injection, UART timing and safe outputs have not been "
"executed."
